a Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯混元Hy4大模型正式全量开源，支持百万上下文与MoE架构</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">敲钟前夜收到联名信：90 位大奖得主质疑 Anthropic 安全人设</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信12月起强制要求AI短剧提交生成全流程证明视频并上调时长门槛</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌正式向开发者开放世界模型 Genie 4，每分钟调用成本约 6 美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3715b1972802d48a6b558e7509cbb221.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于11月19日正式向开发者开放世界模型Genie 4，支持通过Gemini API及AI Studio调用。该模型可根据文本、图像或图文组合，实时生成720p、24fps的可交互世界，并同步生成环境音与对白，画面响应延迟在0.2至0.5秒之间。Genie 4主要面向交互原型设计、空间可视化及机器人与智能体训练场景。在技术限制方面，目前仅支持16:9横屏，无持久化3D资产，且单次会话上限为120秒，最佳连贯性维持在45至90秒。计费方面，该服务不设免费层，按Token计费，折算后视频输出成本约为6.05美元/分钟。官方提醒，用户需显式调用complete()或cancel()接口以停止计费，且目前仅由美国数据中心提供服务。同期，谷歌还发布了推理模型Gemini 4 Neon及Robotics插件。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果正研发通用型全功能AI代理，计划于2027年底正式发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/119548af0d0ca736099893bcd138f7ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司正加速研发一款通用型全功能AI Agent，旨在与OpenAI、Anthropic及Meta等竞品直接对标，计划于2027年底正式发布。该项目由软件工程主管Craig Federighi主导，定位远超现有Siri及Apple Intelligence Suite。其核心技术涵盖跨应用操作、网页浏览、代码编写与调试、API调用及多步骤任务规划。为确保安全性，苹果将构建强权限模型与沙箱机制，延续端侧隐私保护策略。面对Meta Muse及谷歌Gemini等竞品在Mac端控制能力的快速渗透，苹果正通过收紧生态权限进行防御，例如在macOS 27.3测试版中大幅增加第三方AI工具的授权步骤。此举标志着系统级入口争夺战升级，苹果试图通过生态壁垒与自研AI代理双管齐下，重构端侧AI竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元Hy4大模型正式全量开源，支持百万上下文与MoE架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/251646a3fd79fbdf3d24a2b3fcafa612.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，腾讯混元团队正式宣布Hy4大模型全量开源，模型权重已同步上线GitHub、Hugging Face、ModelScope及GitCode平台。此次开源标志着混元LLM系列实现全系开放，涵盖Hy3系列及Hy4系列。旗舰版Hy4采用MoE混合专家架构，总参数量770B，激活参数49B，支持100万Token上下文窗口。同步开源的还有高性价比版本Hy4flash，总参数量224B，激活参数12B，支持多模态输入及100万Token上下文。两款模型均采用Apache 2.0协议，允许商业使用与修改。腾讯同步发布了Hy4安全评估卡片，明确训练数据剔除了漏洞利用等攻击性内容，并经腾讯玄武与科恩实验室审计，确保模型安全性。此次全量开源为开发者提供了更灵活的部署选择，助力企业级应用落地与二次开发。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">敲钟前夜收到联名信：90 位大奖得主质疑 Anthropic 安全人设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">敲钟前夜收到联名信：90 位大奖得主质疑 Anthropic 安全人设AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 20, 202643北京时间 11 月 20 日凌晨，Anthropic 登陆纳斯达克，IPO 募资 813 亿美元，超越 SpaceX 的 750 亿美元纪录，成为史上最大规模股票发行，首日收涨 17.07%，市值 1.271 万亿美元。但比开盘钟声更早响起的，是一封联署公开信——上市前夕，一份名为《MisAnthropic Statement》的声明流传开来，矛头直指这家公司的“安全人设”。诺奖、图灵奖、菲尔兹奖罕见同框 联署名单近 90 人，覆盖平时观点相左的多个阵营：诺贝尔奖、图灵奖、菲尔兹奖得主，AI 安全研究者，开源社区代表，甚至还有加速主义人士。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信12月起强制要求AI短剧提交生成全流程证明视频并上调时长门槛</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4fd4b30eb28952348d85be073832bdf1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信短剧内容中心发布公告，将于2026年12月1日起正式实施两项审核新规。首先，平台将短剧单集最低时长门槛由45秒上调至1分钟，旨在提升叙事完整性。其次，针对包含AI生成内容的剧集，强制要求提交“AI制作证明视频”。该证明材料需完整展示AI生成全流程，具体涵盖资产列表、剧集列表、对应分镜的提示词（Prompt）及部分分镜播放画面，支持PDF、JPG、PNG及MP4格式，单文件不超过10MB，最多上传3个。此举旨在通过提示词与工程资产核验机制，解决生成式AI在微短剧领域带来的素材盗用与版权归属模糊问题。通过强化工程文件核验，微信不仅能有效减少因资料缺失导致的审核回退，提升审核效率，还将推动AI短剧行业向规范化与精品化演进，确保内容原创真实性。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
